FluxTorrent — Credits & Lineage
===============================

FluxTorrent is a maintained, modernized fork. It exists only because of the
work of the projects and people below. All original attribution is preserved.

PROJECT LINEAGE
---------------
FluxTorrent (PHP 8 / qBittorrent / Prowlarr fork)
                        https://github.com/JawshTheDark/torrentflux-ng
  ← TorrentFlux-NG      https://github.com/epsylon3/torrentflux   (Epsylon3)
  ← TorrentFlux-b4rt    (the b4rt team and contributors)
  ← TorrentFlux         (Bytemonkey / Qbittorrent-era original authors)

The modernization (PHP 5 → 8.5 port, qBittorrent Web-API backend, Prowlarr
search integration, Docker packaging, dark UI, HTML5 player) is by JawshTheDark.

